OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Communards singer on female
OL,4,Amusical inspirations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former singer in The Communards says
OL,7,Fthat researching her female musical
OL,8,Finspirations has helped her to "fall in
OL,9,Flove" with their stories and helped her
OL,10,Fproduce music in their honour.
OL,12,FSarah Jane Morris cited Tracey Chapman,
OL,13,FAmy Winehouse and modern artists
OL,14,Fincluding Raye among her inspirations,
OL,15,Fsome of whom she has dedicated songs
OL,16,Fto.
OL,18,FThe singer-songwriter discussed her
OL,19,Ffemale musical inspirations ahead of
OL,20,Fperforming her second concept album of
OL,21,Fsongs written about and inspired by
OL,22,FChapman, Winehouse and Dolly Parton.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
