OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Communards singer on female
OL,4,Amusical inspirations
OL,5,
OL,6,FMorris, from St Leonards in West
OL,7,FSussex, said: "I wanted to find out
OL,8,Fabout the singer-songwriters who had
OL,9,Fpaved the way for me."
